    Bump Checkstyle to version `14.0.0` (#39654)
    
    Pin the required Checkstyle job to JDK 21 while keeping Java 8 source
    compatibility for normal builds.
    
    Remove the obsolete JavadocStyle module, resolve violations exposed by
    Checkstyle 14, and document the local final exception required by
    Checkstyle.

